@direction LR
@spacing 60

[1 - We meet for 60 minutes on Zoom or Google Meet, with your GHL on screen] -> [2 - We follow one new lead through your intake and lead-routing workflow]
[2 - We follow one new lead through your intake and lead-routing workflow] -> [3 - We check the triggers, branching, timing and routing of your 8 follow-ups]
[3 - We check the triggers, branching, timing and routing of your 8 follow-ups] -> [4 - Does an older workflow fire on the same trigger? We mark which one stays]
[4 - Does an older workflow fire on the same trigger? We mark which one stays] -> [5 - Anything instant or timed stays in GHL, like speed-to-lead and consult reminders]
[5 - Anything instant or timed stays in GHL, like speed-to-lead and consult reminders] -> [6 - A webhook sends each reply to Claude, and Claude's tag starts proposal chase or nurture]
[6 - A webhook sends each reply to Claude, and Claude's tag starts proposal chase or nurture] -> [7 - Each workflow adds an entry tag in its first step, so Claude can see who entered it]
[7 - Each workflow adds an entry tag in its first step, so Claude can see who entered it] -> [8 - An If/Else step before each message checks that its merge fields are filled in]
[8 - An If/Else step before each message checks that its merge fields are filled in] -> [9 - A field is blank? The message waits and you get a task to fill it in]
[9 - A field is blank? The message waits and you get a task to fill it in] -> [10 - Claude looks only for new leads with no entry tag, not through all ~2,400 contacts]
[10 - Claude looks only for new leads with no entry tag, not through all ~2,400 contacts] -> [11 - Claude sends you one report: blank fields, missed leads, anyone stuck in a pipeline]
[11 - Claude sends you one report: blank fields, missed leads, anyone stuck in a pipeline] -> [12 - After the call, you get your prioritized list in writing, leads at risk first]
